---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import siteData from "../../content/site.json";
---
<BaseLayout title="Personal styling" description="Talk directly with Sage about an outfit, an event, or a new direction for your personal style.">
  <section class="page-hero page-hero-narrow">
    <span class="eyebrow">Start with what feels off</span>
    <h1>Personal styling</h1>
    <p>You do not need a fashion vocabulary or a perfectly defined aesthetic. Tell Sage what you are trying to wear, where you feel stuck, and what you want to feel like in the outfit.</p>
    <a class="button button-primary" href={siteData.business.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Talk it through with Sage</a>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section styling-conversation">
    <div class="styling-quote">
      <span class="eyebrow">A good place to begin</span>
      <blockquote>“I know what I like when I see it. I just cannot make it work on me.”</blockquote>
    </div>
    <div class="styling-response">
      <h2>That is enough to start.</h2>
      <p>Send photos, screenshots, an event flyer, pieces from your closet, or even examples of outfits you almost like. Sage can help narrow down what is working and what is missing.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section styling-prompts-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Things you can message about</span>
        <h2>Not packages. Just real styling problems.</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="styling-prompts">
      <article><span>01</span><h3>I have somewhere to go and nothing feels right.</h3><p>Build one complete look around the event, the weather, the setting, and how dressed up you actually want to be.</p></article>
      <article><span>02</span><h3>I know the vibe, but I keep buying the wrong pieces.</h3><p>Compare your references with what you wear in real life and identify the shapes, colors, and details that translate.</p></article>
      <article><span>03</span><h3>My closet does not feel like me anymore.</h3><p>Work with what is still useful, figure out what is missing, and stop adding clothes that never leave the hanger.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="page-section styling-send-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Helpful, not required</span>
      <h2>What to send</h2>
    </div>
    <ul class="plain-checklist">
      <li>A photo of the event, place, or general setting</li>
      <li>Outfit references you genuinely like</li>
      <li>Your sizes, measurements, and budget</li>
      <li>Pieces you want to use or avoid</li>
      <li>Anything that makes you uncomfortable in an outfit</li>
    </ul>
    <div class="soft-note compact-note"><p>Pricing, timing, and whether the help happens virtually or in person are worked out directly with Sage.</p></div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
